<title>MEXICO: FOCUS - KN Energy sets higher natgas charge.</title>
<headline>FOCUS - KN Energy sets higher natgas charge.</headline>
<byline>Timna Tanners</byline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. company KN Energy won the latest natural gas distribution rights in Mexico on Wednesday, pledging to charge Hermosillo, Sonora state clients double the tariff of past winning bidders.</p>
<p>The Hermosillo region is the third of a series of natural gas distribution rights auctions designed to boost infrastructure and use of the cleaner fuel.</p>
